{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdVkK84Ch9bAfPRu78PoT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A migration review eats time mostly on reconstructing intent. Create a one-pager in the PR description that covers: (1) what you're moving and why, (2) the sequence of schema changes + backfill steps, (3) rollback plan if something breaks, (4) any data validation you're doing. Bonus: add inline comments at the critical sections (the backfill logic, any locking/sequencing assumptions). \n\nThe tradeoff is writing now to save his reading later—but for a co-founder sign-off, that's worth it. He'll either spot a risk quickly or give thumbs-up without needing to reverse-engineer your thinking."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6943,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6943},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"afd5ec30-1be6-4959-b47a-987ebb722520","timestamp":"2026-07-29T04:51:13.305Z","request_id":"req_011CdVkK6sWxJoTeqYLkWprV"}
